asteroidModels(scene)
    Build three named floating rocks with crop beds and construction blueprints.
    Give each visible target an island, command and optional plot identity.
    Show settlement and attack rings only on unowned islands.
    draw(game) updates crops, timers, labels, ownership, construction and readouts.
    animate(time, fleet) displays at most twelve orbiting ships.
    hit(ray) returns the nearest visible order target, or no selection.
    Camera-free rays and desktop camera rays must select the same objects.
